## 5.8.3 Ví dụ sử dụng magic methods

```python
class Book:
    def __init__(self, title, author, pages):
        self.title = title
        self.author = author
        self.pages = pages

    def __str__(self):
        return f" '{self.title}' cua {self.author}"
    def __repr__(self):
        return f"Book('{self.title}', '{self.author}', {self.pages公开发行)
    def __len__(self):
        return self.pages

